{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>VR Helsing</strong></i> is a <i>Boomer Shooter</i> set in the Victorian era, where <strong>darkness</strong> and <strong>horror</strong> lurk around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/extras/590753db461f612888cc4e0c997a7397.poster.avif?t=1756960974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/extras/590753db461f612888cc4e0c997a7397.webm?t=1756960974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/extras/590753db461f612888cc4e0c997a7397.mp4?t=1756960974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the legendary monster hunter <i>Abraham <strong>Van Helsing</strong></i>, who is forced to return from his retirement to once again face the beasts he once fought and defeated. They are back for revenge. The player will face fearsome classic monsters, such as <strong>Frankenstein</strong> and <strong>Dracula</strong>, in frenetic combat, using the objects in each scenario to their advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the low-poly pixel art with a classic monochromatic visual style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the grappling hook to exploit the vertical design of each level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your arsenal to annihilate your enemies in unique ways</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/extras/3205efc9610a541273246233248f2196.poster.avif?t=1756960974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/extras/3205efc9610a541273246233248f2196.webm?t=1756960974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/extras/3205efc9610a541273246233248f2196.mp4?t=1756960974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540160?t=1756960974","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540160?t=1756960974","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/2f3a810125012d5942bfc26b517fd19fb8af517a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756960974","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/2f3a810125012d5942bfc26b517fd19fb8af517a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756960974","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains explicit graphic violence & gore imagery. The game contains cursing words.\r\nThere is Christian symbology."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>VR Helsing</strong></i> is a <i>Boomer Shooter</i> set in the Victorian era, where <strong>darkness</strong> and <strong>horror</strong> lurk around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/extras/590753db461f612888cc4e0c997a7397.poster.avif?t=1756960974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite